<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal's net forex reserves rise in 1996.</title>
<headline>Portugal's net forex reserves rise in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Portugal's net foreign exchange reserves, including gold valued at market prices, rose $468 million in 1996 to $21.357 billion, the central bank said in its December report.</p>
</text>
